          "title": "神经元的全部",
          "markdown": "- 加权求和：$\\sum_i w_i x_i$\n- 再加偏置：$h = \\sum_i w_i x_i + b$\n- 向量写法：$h = w \\cdot x + b$",
          "layout": "follow"
        }
      ],
